WHAT YOU NEED TO DO
-------------------
1. Log in to your tenant portal and open this inspection
2. Walk through each room and rate the condition of every item
3. Take at least 2 photos per room where you find any damage or issues
4. Add notes describing any problems you observe
5. Submit the inspection when all rooms are complete

Photos are required for any room with damage. Please ensure images are clear and show the full extent of any issues found.

